<title>SPAIN: Bank of Spain buying pesetas at 84.95 per mark.</title>
<headline>Bank of Spain buying pesetas at 84.95 per mark.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain was buying pesetas at levels of around 84.95 per mark, dealers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The Bank of Spain declined to comment, as is its usual policy.</p>
<p>Earlier today the central bank cut its key money market rate by 25 basis points to 5.75 percent.  </p>
